          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus concluded, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On another Sabbath Jesus went into a synagogue and taught. A man was there whose right hand was paralysed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some teachers of the Law and some Pharisees wanted a reason to accuse Jesus of doing wrong, so they watched him closely to see if he would heal on the Sabbath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus knew their thoughts and said to the man, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " The man got up and stood there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus said to them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He looked around at them all; then he said",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "said",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; some manuscripts have",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "said angrily.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to the man, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " He did so, and his hand became well again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were filled with rage and began to discuss among themselves what they could do to Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Jesus went up a hill to pray and spent the whole night there praying to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When day came, he called his disciples to him and chose twelve of them, whom he named apostles: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon (whom he named Peter) and his brother Andrew; James and John, Philip and Bartholomew, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matthew and Thomas, James son of Alphaeus, and Simon (who was called the Patriot), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judas son of James, and Judas Iscariot, who became the traitor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus had come down from the hill with the apostles, he stood on a level place with a large number of his disciples. A large crowd of people was there from all over Judea and from Jerusalem and from the coastal cities of Tyre and Sidon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they had come to hear him and to be healed of their diseases. Those who were troubled by evil spirits also came and were healed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the people tried to touch him, for power was going out from him and healing them all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus looked at his disciples and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
